  <name>Renamite</name>
  <summary>Motion animation editor</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Renamite is a motion / vector animation editor.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Vector primitives with fill / stroke / gradients</li>
      <li>Image and font asset import</li>
      <li>Layer rename, reorder and property editing with undo</li>
      <li>Timeline scrubbing and basic animation</li>
      <li>Export frames as PNG/SVG and animations as Lottie (.ren / .renb)</li>
      <li>GPU-accelerated canvas via wgpu</li>
      <li>Cross-platform: Linux, macOS, Windows, Web (WASM), Android</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <developer_name>MLM Games</developer_name>
